      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, just saw the preliminary docs. can i get a quick high-level summary of where we stand? specifically, are there any critical vulnerabilities that would require immediate, costly architectural changes? we're trying to finalize the budget for the next quarter so i need to know if there are any big surprises coming. thanks.",
