      "content": "wait, so what do you mean by \"not critical\" vs then saying there are \"several critical areas\" we need to discuss with the board? that sounds a bit contradictory. if the legacy auth stuff has issues, shouldn't we be looking at that now instead of waiting two months for a report? just being straight with me, is this something that could actually get us breached if we don't fix it immediately?",
